  "worked_solution": "The complement of $S,$ denoted $\\overset{\u2015}{S},$ consists of every element in the universal set $U$ that is not in the set $S.$\n\nThe only elements of $U$ that are not in $S$ are $t,$ $u,$ and $v.$\n\nTherefore, the complement of $S$ is\n\n$$\n\\overset{\u2015}{S}={t,u,v}.\n$$",
